  + [requirement] is implement or harden visible stale/error states for payload, block adoption, cut insertion, and source reveal
  + [fork_commit] is d62e5b63
  + [solution] is The Lounge workbench now renders status pills for refresh, block/cut counts, blocked insertion, selected source, source reveal, hidden pane reveal, stale source visibility, and latest error state
  + [solution] is AlienHand refinement fetch errors now include the resolver URL and API path that failed
  + [solution] is app-owned runtime proof now checks the new status surface strings and CSS classes
  + [data_design_reason] is status messages expose operation_state, validation_state, and provenance/source reveal state without making UI state authoritative
  + [ui_interaction_reason] is blocked actions are explained through visible feedback instead of disabled controls alone

  = must: treat visible status as part of the workbench component contract
  = must: keep source reveal failures explicit when a cut, block, or pane is unavailable
  = must: keep resolver fetch failures actionable enough for local runtime debugging

